<title>POLAND: Animex wins DM 27 mln German goose contract.</title>
<headline>Animex wins DM 27 mln German goose contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader and producer Animex SA has signed a contract to supply 27 million marks worth of geese to Germany, the firm said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The statement said the contract would be realised in the third and fourth quarters but gave no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
<p>E-mail: warsaw.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
